### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "테스터"
}

### 로그인 (먼저 실행하면 토큰 자동 저장!)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 할 일 추가
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "스프링 공부하기",
  "date": "2026-03-22"
}

### 할 일 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?date=2026-03-22
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 전체 랭킹
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rank

### 내 정보
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rank/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 출석 체크
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 출석 현황 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 이번 달 출석 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 감점 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/penalty

### 초기화 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reset

### 채팅방 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chatrooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "스프링 스터디방"
}

> {% client.global.set("roomId", response.body.roomId); %}

### 채팅방 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chatrooms

### 채팅방 단일 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chatrooms/{{roomId}}

### 메시지 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/messages/{{roomId}}